      ],
      "source": "https://www.luquillobeach.com/travel-guide/the-history-of-luquillo-beach-and-its-surroundings",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town spans 12 miles of Atlantic shoreline and anchors the Northeast Ecological Corridor Nature Reserve.",
